  "how": "every glyph on this sheet was cropped at 9x from the de-sheared exposure and set beside B1's labelled glyph for the form proposed, and only committed when the two matched stroke for stroke. That test moved three readings: the footing's second and third figures from 5 to 3, and line 1 from 7 to 9.",
